  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_01",
      "hash64": "4A602E61B3DEF66A",
      "text": "¿Quieres que le eche un ojo al tamaño de tu[VAR 0x1101(00FD,0100)]s\\nPokémon?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1101",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FD",
            "0100"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_02",
      "hash64": "4A602D61B3DEF4B7",
      "text": "¿Qué Pokémon quieres enseñarme?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_03",
      "hash64": "4A602C61B3DEF304",
      "text": "Vamos a echar un vistazo a [VAR 0x0102(0001)]...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0102",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_04",
      "hash64": "4A602B61B3DEF151",
      "text": "¡Esto sí que es un ejemplar colosal y lo demás\\nson tonterías!\\c\\n¡Es muy raro ver uno de este tamaño!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_05",
      "hash64": "4A602A61B3DEEF9E",
      "text": "Habría que inscribirlo en algún libro de récords...\\n¡El [VAR 0x0101(0001)] más grande del mundo!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_06",
      "hash64": "4A602961B3DEEDEB",
      "text": "¡Qué bárbaro! ¡Este ejemplar es grandísimo!\\nDebe de infundir mucha seguridad contar con\\r\\nuno así como compañero.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_07",
      "hash64": "4A602861B3DEEC38",
      "text": "Ajá... Yo diría que es bastante más grande que\\notros de su especie.\\c\\n¡Cuida bien de un Pokémon tan especial como\\neste!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_08",
      "hash64": "4A602761B3DEEA85",
      "text": "Es un pelín más grande que la mayoría de su\\nespecie, pero tampoco mucho. Anda así así.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_09",
      "hash64": "4A602661B3DEE8D2",
      "text": "No es ni grande ni chiqui; ¡está justo en la media\\nde su especie!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_10",
      "hash64": "4A5CA961B3DBDE94",
      "text": "Es un pelín más chiqui que la mayoría de su\\nespecie. Le faltó pegar el último estirón.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_11",
      "hash64": "4A5CAA61B3DBE047",
      "text": "Uy, es bastante más pequeño que la media de\\nsu especie.\\c\\n¡Cuida bien de un Pokémon tan especial como\\neste!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_12",
      "hash64": "4A5CAB61B3DBE1FA",
      "text": "Ay, ¡qué cosita tan chiquitita! Una estrellita\\ndiminuta en un firmamento de [VAR 0x0101(0001)].\\c\\n¡Es toda una monada!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_13",
      "hash64": "4A5CAC61B3DBE3AD",
      "text": "¡Este ejemplar es diminuto! ¡Es muy raro ver uno\\nde este tamaño!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_14",
      "hash64": "4A5CA561B3DBD7C8",
      "text": "¡Casi diría que este es el [VAR 0x0101(0001)] más\\npequeño del mundo!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_15",
      "hash64": "4A5CA661B3DBD97B",
      "text": "¡Qué feliz soy! Muchas gracias por enseñarme un\\nejemplar tan grande. Le voy a dar un emblema\\r\\npor estar tan hermosote.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_16",
      "hash64": "4A5CA761B3DBDB2E",
      "text": "¡Qué ilusión! Jamás pensé que vería un ejemplar\\ntan chiquitito. ¡Muchas gracias por enseñármelo!\\c\\nLe voy a dar un emblema por ser tan majo.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sub_035_system_01",
      "hash64": "C6E9E65F3C949448",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]¡[VAR 0x0102(0001)] ha recibido el Emblema\\nEnormidad!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
